    "body": "We always use the max number for the limit. It means that we always over fetch even if the user don't set `showMore`. We could provide a more accurate value based on the `showMore` option.\r\n\r\n```\r\nshowMore ? showMoreLimit : limit\r\n```",
    "commit_id": "b7ff0ff2f81747deaedc19eefe9b1063ce78e5db",
    "created_at": "2018-12-13T15:47:35Z",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -149,22 +158,13 @@ export default function connectHierarchicalMenu(renderFn, unmountFn) {\n           ],\n         };\n \n-        if (limit !== undefined) {\n-          const currentMaxValuesPerFacet =\n-            currentConfiguration.maxValuesPerFacet || 0;\n-          if (showMoreLimit === undefined) {\n-            widgetConfiguration.maxValuesPerFacet = Math.max(\n-              currentMaxValuesPerFacet,\n-              limit\n-            );\n-          } else {\n-            widgetConfiguration.maxValuesPerFacet = Math.max(\n-              currentMaxValuesPerFacet,\n-              limit,\n-              showMoreLimit\n-            );\n-          }\n-        }\n+        const currentMaxValuesPerFacet =\n+          currentConfiguration.maxValuesPerFacet || 0;\n+\n+        widgetConfiguration.maxValuesPerFacet = Math.max(\n+          currentMaxValuesPerFacet,\n+          showMoreLimit",
